 "book.energizedpower.page.energized_alloy_ingot": "充能合金錠是 Energized Power 中最強的合金。",
 "book.energizedpower.page.energizing_speed_upgrades.1": "充能速度升級會讓充能器運作得更快，但總耗能維持不變。",
 "book.energizedpower.page.energizing_speed_upgrades.2": "每刻的耗能會隨速度提升的同等比例增加。",
